@ExpenseTracker.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:5001

### Record a new expense
POST {{ExpenseTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Coffee beans",
  "category": "Groceries",
  "amount": 12.50,
  "date": "2026-11-10"
}

### List all expenses
GET {{ExpenseTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses

### Get a single expense
GET {{ExpenseTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/1

### Monthly summary
GET {{ExpenseTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/summary/2026/11

### Delete an expense
DELETE {{ExpenseTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/expenses/1
